{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1445823-new-community-forum-site-swordofcreation-net","id":1445823,"title":"New Community Forum/Site - swordofcreation.net","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-04-25T08:30:02-07:00","id":1445823,"title":"New Community Forum/Site - swordofcreation.net","content":"Apparently Ian and Lioness are ok with me promoting this on here so I wanted to give a site, <a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">SWORD OF CREATION</a>, that a few of us have been working on a push.<br /> <br /> I've lurked on this forum for years at this point, been playing Exalted since 1e and was a playtester on 3e. As great as I think this forum being here is, my feeling for a long time has been that most of the visible offerings for the Exalted community struggle to really let a lot of content breathe and get the attention it deserves. Boards like this and megathreads on other sites mean that once the charms, homebrew and art someone's spent time and effort on gets buried by general talk and conversation, it just gets lost. The Exalted reddit can be like a ghost town and Discord is amazing but means content and discussion ends up a little hidden from view.<br /> <br /> I remember sites like The Freedom Stone and how having a dedicated Exalted fan site meant that content could be broken up across boards, more easily found and attention given to people's work. So that's what I've set out to make and test with my group. A new dedicated Exalted forum with an aim to focus on fanwork and content, where a new player can quickly see and find just how much homebrew and creative content is out there. And where experienced players can discuss and share stuff without worrying about it having disappeared within a week.<br /> <br /> Right now it's just what my group have been testing out on it, but if this is the sort of thing people feel like would enhance the community I'd love if they would sign up, signal boost and share their stuff to shape it into something they want to see.<br /> <br /> To try and drive a bit of attention at the start and encourage people to post to the boards, <u><b>we're running 3 contests for people's artworks and homebrew each with $20 prizes each</b></u>. It costs nothing to enter so the only barrier to entry is the time it takes to make an account and post your stuff for people to appreciate.<br /> <br /> Look forward to seeing you over there on <a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">swordofcreation.net</a> or if this ends up failing to continue seeing what people have to offer here","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":14}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13512-andrix","name":"andrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T09:48:54-07:00","id":1445838,"title":"","content":"I'm here for an Exalted Compendium type project. I'll pop by and check it out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","na