ful as it is ambitious.<br /> <br /> Will you be joining the art contest, Gonzo?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes! I will!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://fivefoldcomicstance.thecomicseries.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Join the Strife</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/90-gonzo","name":"Gonzo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar90_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"934"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-28T16:07:02-07:00","id":1446366,"title":"","content":"It's great seeing everyone here. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThe very existence of flame-throwers proves that some time, somewhere, someone said to themselves, You know, I want to set those people over there on fire, but I'm just not close enough to get the job done.\u201d George Carlin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/123-trax","name":"Trax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar123_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T10:48:41-07:00","id":1446999,"title":"","content":"I'm just going to bump this the once to give a quick update now that we're a week in, then it can fall away to obscurity down the boards.<br /> <br /> We've had a load of really nice interest and some great stuff uploaded, a lot of it that's been seen here before but that might have been missed or got a little lost over time. There's some really great fiction been included now for instance. We've also rearranged and consolidated the forums a touch, bringing most of the news and discussion into a single place rather than it being too spread out.<br /> <br /> And we've also reworked our space for games and actual plays, including a sub-forum for anyone who wants to do forum games/PbP with a handful of people already looking to start a game potentially.<br /> <br /> Finally, we've still got $20 prizes for our contests which haven't had as much attention as I'd have hoped so far, so you've nothing to lose for posting something for them.<br /> <br /> Basically, if you glanced at things early on but there wasn't much there, maybe consider taking another glance now and see whats been shared <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13512-andrix","name":"andrix","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T03:51:09-07:00","id":1447167,"title":"","content":"It's great!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26777-bernhigg","name":"BernhigG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26777_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-22T01:55:32-07:00","id":1449236,"title":"","content":"It must be good for business t